01:03:23.990 --> 01:03:26.390
which is that ceiling
function of x is bigger than 1

01:03:26.390 --> 01:03:29.120
or equal to x, and it's
less than x plus 1.

01:03:29.120 --> 01:03:31.730
So it's somewhere
between these two things.

01:03:31.730 --> 01:03:33.897
So you can put the second part.

01:03:33.897 --> 01:03:36.230
We just need the second part,
